{"seq":3,"slug":"pbr-materials","title":"PBR 材质","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/shader-programming/shading-techniques/pbr-materials","wordCount":1372,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"pbr-材质\">PBR 材质</h1><p>在 PBR 普及之前，美术调一个材质要在不同光照下反复试错：白天看着对的金属，到了室内就发黑发假。基于物理的渲染（Physically Based Rendering）终结了这种玄学。它的承诺很简单：用少数几个有明确物理含义的参数描述材质，配合守恒能量的 BRDF，让同一个材质在任何光照环境下都自动表现一致、可信。今天从 Unreal、Unity 到 glTF 标准，PBR 已是不容置疑的事实标准。这一篇把前两篇的光照理论与纹理实践，收束成一套可落地的材质系统。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-金属度-粗糙度工作流\">核心概念：金属度/粗糙度工作流</h2><p>PBR 最主流的参数化是「金属度-粗糙度」（metallic-roughness）工作流，它把一个表面拆成几个物理量：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;基础色 Base Color&quot;] --&gt; E[&quot;Cook-Torrance BRDF&quot;]&#10;    B[&quot;金属度 Metallic&lt;br/&gt;0=电介质 1=金属&quot;] --&gt; E&#10;    C[&quot;粗糙度 Roughness&lt;br/&gt;0=镜面 1=磨砂&quot;] --&gt; E&#10;    D[&quot;法线 / AO / 自发光&quot;] --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;直接光着色&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; G[&quot;IBL 间接光着色&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; H[&quot;最终像素颜色&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; H\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"基础色 Base Color\"] --&gt; E[\"Cook-Torrance BRDF\"]\n    B[\"金属度 Metallic&lt;br/&gt;0=电介质 1=金属\"] --&gt; E\n    C[\"粗糙度 Roughness&lt;br/&gt;0=镜面 1=磨砂\"] --&gt; E\n    D[\"法线 / AO / 自发光\"] --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[\"直接光着色\"]\n    E --&gt; G[\"IBL 间接光着色\"]\n    F --&gt; H[\"最终像素颜色\"]\n    G --&gt; H</pre><p>金属度决定材质是导体还是电介质：金属（金属度=1）没有漫反射、其镜面反射带颜色（金的高光是金色）；非金属（金属度=0）有彩色漫反射、镜面反射近乎白色且较弱。粗糙度控制微表面的散乱程度，直接喂给 <a href=\"lighting-models\">光照模型与 BRDF</a> 里 GGX 分布的参数。这套设计的精妙在于：美术只需理解「这是金属吗」「这有多糙」两个直觉问题，剩下的物理由着色器保证正确。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从粗糙度到-ggx-brdf-的落地\">从粗糙度到 GGX：BRDF 的落地</h2><p>PBR 的镜面项就是前一篇推导的 Cook-Torrance BRDF，这里把它的三项与 PBR 参数挂钩。GGX 法线分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 用粗糙度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha = roughness^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ug</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">hn</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">es</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 控制（注意是平方，让感知更线性）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>G</mi><mi>X</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mi>π</mi><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>h</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{GGX}(h) = \\frac{\\alpha^2}{\\pi\\left((n \\cdot h)^2(\\alpha^2 - 1) + 1\\right)^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">GGX</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5851em;vertical-align:-1.094em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.156em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.954em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.094em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>菲涅尔项 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 的基础反射率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 由金属度决定：电介质统一取约 0.04（4% 反射），金属则取基础色本身。这一步用 <code>lerp</code> 漂亮地统一了两种材质：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"hlsl\" data-code=\"float3 F0 = lerp(float3(0.04, 0.04, 0.04), baseColor, metallic);&#10;float3 F  = F0 + (1.0 - F0) * pow(1.0 - saturate(dot(h, v)), 5.0); // Schlick&#10;&#10;float a  = roughness * roughness;&#10;float a2 = a * a;&#10;float ndh = saturate(dot(n, h));&#10;float D  = a2 / (3.14159265 * pow(ndh * ndh * (a2 - 1.0) + 1.0, 2.0));&#10;&#10;float3 kd = (1.0 - F) * (1.0 - metallic);          // 金属无漫反射&#10;float3 diffuse  = kd * baseColor / 3.14159265;     // Lambert 守恒归一化&#10;float3 specular = D * F * G / (4.0 * ndv * ndl);    // G 见上一篇几何项&#10;float3 color = (diffuse + specular) * lightColor * ndl;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>float3 F0 = lerp(float3(0.04, 0.04, 0.04), baseColor, metallic);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>float3 F  = F0 + (1.0 - F0) * pow(1.0 - saturate(dot(h, v)), 5.0); // Schlick</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>float a  = roughness * roughness;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>float a2 = a * a;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>float ndh = saturate(dot(n, h));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>float D  = a2 / (3.14159265 * pow(ndh * ndh * (a2 - 1.0) + 1.0, 2.0));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>float3 kd = (1.0 - F) * (1.0 - metallic);          // 金属无漫反射</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>float3 diffuse  = kd * baseColor / 3.14159265;     // Lambert 守恒归一化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>float3 specular = D * F * G / (4.0 * ndv * ndl);    // G 见上一篇几何项</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>float3 color = (diffuse + specular) * lightColor * ndl;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>漫反射除以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span>、并用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1-F)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 扣掉已被镜面反射走的能量，正是「能量守恒」在代码里的体现——这是 PBR 与老 Blinn-Phong 最本质的区别。</p>\n<h2 id=\"材质纹理-参数图的组织\">材质纹理：参数图的组织</h2><p>PBR 材质的每个参数通常都由一张纹理逐像素提供，这把 <a href=\"texturing-sampling\">纹理与采样</a> 的知识直接用上了。一套标准 PBR 材质常包含：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>贴图</th>\n<th>通道</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>颜色空间</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Base Color / Albedo</td>\n<td>RGB</td>\n<td>表面固有色（不含光照阴影）</td>\n<td>sRGB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Metallic</td>\n<td>R</td>\n<td>金属度 0–1</td>\n<td>线性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Roughness</td>\n<td>R</td>\n<td>粗糙度 0–1</td>\n<td>线性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Normal</td>\n<td>RGB</td>\n<td>切线空间法线扰动</td>\n<td>线性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ambient Occlusion</td>\n<td>R</td>\n<td>环境光遮蔽</td>\n<td>线性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Emissive</td>\n<td>RGB</td>\n<td>自发光</td>\n<td>sRGB</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个关键陷阱是颜色空间：base color 和 emissive 是给人眼看的颜色，存为 sRGB、采样时需转线性；而金属度、粗糙度、法线是物理数据，必须存为线性，绝不能套 sRGB 解码。搞错会让金属泛白、法线方向偏移。为节省采样，工程上常把 metallic/roughness/AO 打包进一张图的 RGB 三通道（ORM/MRA 贴图），减少纹理读取数——这又是 <a href=\"../optimization-tools/shader-optimization\">着色器性能优化</a> 关心的带宽问题。法线贴图从切线空间转世界空间，依赖 <a href=\"../foundations/coordinate-spaces\">坐标空间与变换</a> 的 TBN 矩阵。</p>\n<h2 id=\"间接光-pbr-离不开-ibl\">间接光：PBR 离不开 IBL</h2><p>只算直接光的 PBR 在阴影里会一片死黑，因为现实中任何角落都有环境反弹光。PBR 必须配合基于图像的光照（IBL）才完整。漫反射间接光从预积分的辐照度图取；镜面间接光用「分割求和近似」：预过滤的环境贴图按粗糙度选 mipmap 层级，再乘以一张预计算的 BRDF 积分查找表（存 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 缩放与偏移）。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mtext>PrefilteredEnv</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>brdfLUT.r</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>brdfLUT.g</mtext><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{spec} \\approx \\text{PrefilteredEnv}(r, roughness) \\cdot \\left(F_0 \\cdot \\text{brdfLUT.r} + \\text{brdfLUT.g}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ec</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PrefilteredEnv</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ug</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">hn</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ess</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">brdfLUT.r</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">brdfLUT.g</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这套预计算正是 <a href=\"lighting-models\">光照模型与 BRDF</a> 里 IBL 的具体落地，它依赖立方体贴图的 mipmap 采样，见 <a href=\"texturing-sampling\">纹理与采样</a>。更进一步的实时全局光照（如 Lumen）会动态替换这些静态环境贴图，但每个像素仍跑同一套 PBR BRDF。</p>\n<h2 id=\"标准-扩展与一致性\">标准、扩展与一致性</h2><p>PBR 的价值很大程度来自跨工具一致性。glTF 2.0 把金属度-粗糙度工作流定为开放标准，让模型在不同引擎间外观可移植；其扩展（如 KHR_materials_transmission 透射、clearcoat 清漆层、sheen 织物光泽）覆盖了基础模型表达不了的材质。Unreal 与 Unity 各有自己的 PBR 实现细节，但都遵循同一物理框架，差异主要在 IBL 预计算和能量补偿的具体公式上。这些跨引擎、跨平台的实现差异如何收敛，关系到 <a href=\"../optimization-tools/cross-platform-shaders\">跨平台与着色器编译</a>。</p>\n<p>值得一提的是另一种工作流——「高光-光泽度」（specular-glossiness），它用一张完整的镜面颜色图代替金属度。它更灵活但更费显存、更易做出违反物理的材质，如今已逐渐让位于金属度-粗糙度工作流。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>PBR 用金属度、粗糙度、基础色等物理参数描述材质，保证在任意光照下外观一致可信。</li>\n<li>镜面项是 <a href=\"lighting-models\">光照模型与 BRDF</a> 的 Cook-Torrance/GGX；金属度通过 <code>lerp</code> 统一了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，能量守恒是与 Blinn-Phong 的本质区别。</li>\n<li>每个参数由一张纹理提供，颜色空间（sRGB vs 线性）绝不能搞错；常把 ORM 打包省带宽。</li>\n<li>PBR 必须配 IBL 才完整，间接光用预过滤环境贴图加 BRDF 查找表的分割求和近似。</li>\n<li>glTF 2.0 把金属度-粗糙度定为开放标准，跨引擎一致性是 PBR 的核心价值。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"PBR 材质","id":"pbr-材质"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：金属度/粗糙度工作流","id":"核心概念-金属度-粗糙度工作流"},{"level":2,"text":"从粗糙度到 GGX：BRDF 的落地","id":"从粗糙度到-ggx-brdf-的落地"},{"level":2,"text":"材质纹理：参数图的组织","id":"材质纹理-参数图的组织"},{"level":2,"text":"间接光：PBR 离不开 IBL","id":"间接光-pbr-离不开-ibl"},{"level":2,"text":"标准、扩展与一致性","id":"标准-扩展与一致性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"纹理与采样","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/shader-programming/shading-techniques/texturing-sampling"},"next":{"title":"后处理效果","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/shader-programming/advanced-effects/post-processing"}}